I'll have a draft request to her in front of you before anything goes out."}

{"message":"Yep — and good news, we've got breathing room. The market's November 22, so there's two weeks to get the endorsement done properly.

One thing to be straight about: a certificate alone can't make them an additional insured. Certificate holder is just a courtesy line on the COI. To actually name Rosebay Market Association as an AI, Tamarack has to issue an endorsement, and the wording on it has to line up with what the market's vendor agreement actually says. If their contract requires specific AI language and we issue a generic version, they may have a certificate that looks right and no coverage behind it.

I'm pulling the policy facts and the vendor-agreement requirements now, and I'll check what form the Rosebay agreement calls for before I ask Tamarack to reissue."}

{"message":"On it — going back to the underwriter's outstanding requests on the Ajax quote and routing them to Maren.

