You'll see the draft to her before anything lands."}

{"message":"On it. I'll line up private rooms for Friday, Nov 27 for 20 people.

Two things I'll watch for: 20 heads usually trips a room or food-and-beverage minimum, and "private room" + "breakfast" narrows the usable venue list fast — many hotels quote a room for a midday session but not an 8am setup. I'm checking availability, total cost including any minimums and setup fees, and whether we already have a preferred venue from our carrier/broker network.

I'll come back with options and a recommendation, and nothing gets booked until you've signed off on it."}

{"message":"On it — second market running on Beatrix's townhouse, matched to the Pinegrove terms so the two numbers are actually comparable.

